ABOUT THE PRODUCT

The HOSKA barefoot sneakers are minimalist urban shoes. With clean lines and a simple design, they’re a versatile model that blends seamlessly into everyday outfits.&nbsp;The hemp canvas upper is naturally durable and breathable, making these shoes a healthier choice for daily wear.&nbsp;
Thanks to the longer lacing, they suit almost any foot type — both higher and lower insteps.&nbsp;

MATERIALS AND PRODUCTION


Upper: Hemp canvas
Lining: Cotton
Laces: Cotton&nbsp;
Sole: 4 mm, natural rubber
Construction: Glued + vulcanized
Origin: Made in Romania&nbsp;


BAREFOOT FEATURES
The HOSKA model meets all the key barefoot criteria:



Thin, flexible sole for better ground feel&nbsp;
Zero-drop construction (consistent sole thickness under the heel and toes) for natural posture and gait&nbsp;
Spacious toe box for healthy foot shape&nbsp;


SHIPPING &amp; RETURNS
We ship almost anywhere in the world! If your country is not listed in our delivery options or you experience any issues with payment, please contact us at info@bohempia.com – we’ll be happy to find the best solution for you.&nbsp; 

 Free EU shipping on orders over 150 €.

 Returns &amp; exchanges: within 14 days of delivery. Exchanges are available within the EU only.

 More information about delivery to your country can be found here, and details on returns are available here.&nbsp;
SHOE CARE
Before the first wear, we recommend a thorough application of protective spray and repeating regularly. Waterproofing helps protect the surface against moisture and dirt, preserves the color, and prolongs the lifespan of your shoes.&nbsp; 

 Clean gently with a soft brush or damp cloth.

 Always let your shoes dry naturally, away from direct heat sources.

 Do not machine wash.

 Give your shoes the care they deserve with our recommended care products.&nbsp;
